    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/11d9440215d536167abc01273b6f2583.poster.avif?t=1755161458\" width=800 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/11d9440215d536167abc01273b6f2583.webm?t=1755161458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/11d9440215d536167abc01273b6f2583.mp4?t=1755161458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will hopefully be available in English, Japanese, Spanish, French, Italian, German, Simplified Chinese and South Korean</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kioku: Last Summer</i> is a cozy, story-driven adventure where you play as Asti, a young girl spending her first summer on the mysterious island of Kioku. Set in a hand-crafted world blending Scandinavian and Japanese influences, players explore, build friendships, play minigames, uncover secrets, and relive the magic of early 2000s childhood summers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/4c23b91eb5a5bccb035256add6df8034.poster.avif?t=1755161458\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/4c23b91eb5a5bccb035256add6df8034.webm?t=1755161458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/4c23b91eb5a5bccb035256add6df8034.mp4?t=1755161458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go fast in bike races, slow down with crab fishing, solve cryptic riddles, and try not to get caught scrumping the neighbor\u2019s apples. Try your hand at Marubi, the latest craze! Collect Marubi creatures and challenge the locals in this heavy-hitting marble game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/d10756eaf26d83d0a6b89c0a5ff69985.poster.avif?t=1755161458\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/d10756eaf26d83d0a6b89c0a5ff69985.webm?t=1755161458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/d10756eaf26d83d0a6b89c0a5ff69985.mp4?t=1755161458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know the locals of your new home! The kids your age and the grown-ups, all have stories and might just need a newcomer like you. Experience the nostalgic bubble that is Kioku, and help tell a Y2K-story about friendship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/030e326cee1f021457a62fb56f8a7371.poster.avif?t=1755161458\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/030e326cee1f021457a62fb56f8a7371.webm?t=1755161458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/030e326cee1f021457a62fb56f8a7371.mp4?t=1755161458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd80 Activities: Collect every crab, solve riddles or bike racing!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Memories: Look at photos and reminisce about your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udea9 Marubi: When the marbles clash, monsters roar \u2013 join the latest craze, MARUBI!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfde\ufe0f Explore: Go anywhere and discover every nook and cranny of the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26e9\ufe0f Japandi: Experience an unique mix of Japanese and Scandinavian design.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/11d9440215d536167abc01273b6f2583.poster.avif?t=1755161458\" width=800 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/11d9440215d536167abc01273b6f2583.webm?t=1755161458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/11d9440215d536167abc01273b6f2583.mp4?t=1755161458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will hopefully be available in English, Japanese, Spanish, French, Italian, German, Simplified Chinese and South Korean</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kioku: Last Summer</i> is a cozy, story-driven adventure where you play as Asti, a young girl spending her first summer on the mysterious island of Kioku. Set in a hand-crafted world blending Scandinavian and Japanese influences, players explore, build friendships, play minigames, uncover secrets, and relive the magic of early 2000s childhood summers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/4c23b91eb5a5bccb035256add6df8034.poster.avif?t=1755161458\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/4c23b91eb5a5bccb035256add6df8034.webm?t=1755161458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/4c23b91eb5a5bccb035256add6df8034.mp4?t=1755161458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go fast in bike races, slow down with crab fishing, solve cryptic riddles, and try not to get caught scrumping the neighbor\u2019s apples. Try your hand at Marubi, the latest craze! Collect Marubi creatures and challenge the locals in this heavy-hitting marble game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/d10756eaf26d83d0a6b89c0a5ff69985.poster.avif?t=1755161458\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/d10756eaf26d83d0a6b89c0a5ff69985.webm?t=1755161458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/d10756eaf26d83d0a6b89c0a5ff69985.mp4?t=1755161458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know the locals of your new home! The kids your age and the grown-ups, all have stories and might just need a newcomer like you. Experience the nostalgic bubble that is Kioku, and help tell a Y2K-story about friendship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/030e326cee1f021457a62fb56f8a7371.poster.avif?t=1755161458\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/030e326cee1f021457a62fb56f8a7371.webm?t=1755161458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/030e326cee1f021457a62fb56f8a7371.mp4?t=1755161458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd80 Activities: Collect every crab, solve riddles or bike racing!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Memories: Look at photos and reminisce about your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udea9 Marubi: When the marbles clash, monsters roar \u2013 join the latest craze, MARUBI!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfde\ufe0f Explore: Go anywhere and discover every nook and cranny of the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26e9\ufe0f Japandi: Experience an unique mix of Japanese and Scandinavian design.</p></li></ul>",
